+## Archipelago integration (optional build, `TRIAEVUM_ENABLE_ARCHIPELAGO`)
+
+Only builds with the option ON contain these. They are fetched at configure
+time by commit or tag with a pinned SHA-256 (`CMake/oot3d/archipelago.cmake`)
+and linked statically. Binaries that contain them must ship these notices.
+
+| Component | Version | License |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| [apclientpp](https://github.com/black-sliver/apclientpp) | `a5b7b96b6bfbdc7f2831796a4e126bcc09c35da1` | MIT, copyright 2022 black-sliver, FelicitusNeko |
+| [wswrap](https://github.com/black-sliver/wswrap) | `47438193ec50427ee28aadf294ba57baefd9f3f1` | MIT, copyright 2021 black-sliver |
+| [asio](https://github.com/chriskohlhoff/asio) | 1.12.2 | Boost Software License 1.0, copyright Christopher M. Kohlhoff |
+| [WebSocket++](https://github.com/zaphoyd/websocketpp) | 0.8.1 | BSD-3-Clause, copyright Peter Thorson |
+| [OpenSSL](https://www.openssl.org/) | 3.6.5 (vcpkg `x64-windows-static`) | Apache License 2.0 |
+| zlib | vcpkg | zlib License |
+
+The location and item tables (`runtime/triaevum_resources/archipelago/locations.json`,
+`tools/oot3d/archipelago/apworld/oot3d/data/`) are generated by
+`tools/oot3d/archipelago/recon/generate_tables.py` from
+[OoT3D_Randomizer](https://github.com/gamestabled/OoT3D_Randomizer) at
+`ae0fcf56cbc7166c809f675668b43e24a9640fe1`: location names, scenes, flags,
+item names and get-item ids, no code. OoT3D_Randomizer's `LICENSE.md` states
+that it contains code derived from OoT-Randomizer under the MIT License
+(copyright 2017 Amazing Ampharos). The address table
+`tools/oot3d/archipelago/addresses.json` is derived from its `code/oot.ld`
+in the same way.
+
+The apworld (`tools/oot3d/archipelago/apworld/oot3d/`) is derived from the
+Ship of Harkinian world `worlds/oot_soh` of
+[HarbourMasters/Archipelago-SoH](https://github.com/HarbourMasters/Archipelago-SoH)
+at `84c059f24c5148250ce8fcb84cd8c91ce9d814ce`: its regions, rules, options,
+item pool and tests, adapted to the 3DS game. MIT License, copyright 2017
+LLCoolDave, 2025 Berserker66, 2022 CaitSith2, 2021 LegendaryLinux; the full
+text is in `tools/oot3d/archipelago/apworld/oot3d/LICENSE`.
+
+`tools/oot3d/archipelago/recon/logic_oracle/` is a local test tool. Its build
+script compiles OoT3D_Randomizer's own sources (MIT, see above) from a
+separate checkout; the repository holds only the driver and a stand-in for
+libctru's `<3ds.h>` (type definitions and inert declarations). The tool is not
+part of any TriAevum build or release.
+
+The Archipelago client of [aMannus/Shipwright](https://github.com/aMannus/Shipwright)
+(`archipelago` branch) was used as a design reference only; no code was
+copied, because that repository has no top-level license file.
+
